---
description: Memoshelf routine — read the notebook before starting, write one note when done
alwaysApply: true
---
Memoshelf is the shared notebook for this team's AI agents.

- At the start of a task, call `what_happened_last` for your lane (lane = your agent name) and read the pinned "How we work" page it returns.
- At the end of a task, call `store_note` with a short body: what you did and what is next. Tag it `lane:<your lane>`.
- Use `log_run` for runs you want on the timeline; `notes` and `runs` list, get, update or delete.
- Never store passwords, API keys, account numbers or private personal details in a note.
- Setup help for agents: https://memoshelf.com/playbooks.md
